agents-gitflow-guard README · Built-in defaults & deep-merge override：When you do create `gitflow-guard.config.json`, its fields are **deep-merged over the defaults**: each field/role you write replaces the default for that field/role, everything you don't write keeps the default. Write only what you want to change:

```jsonc
{
  "branches": { "production": ["release-[\\w-]+"] }  // defaults keep develop+main; production is added
}
```

